{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0023_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "07360f8adc0b5f9e6fadcbece257f39c42c02aaa194fe28ab56155bf55a2ec0d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまなのです。\n姫はもう、ばたんきゅー！なのです～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你辛苦了唷。\n公主已经累到快要砰一声倒下了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0023_1001_p", "source_sha256": "63fc53ea942a1ab8c4abc5d5d965df713a1781e8dc37a1a824864e357d0d03f8", "ja": "お疲れさま。動物園のステージ公演、面白かったな。\nどの衣装のまつりも、最高に輝いてたぞ！", "zh": "辛苦你了，动物园的舞台公演非常有趣呢。\n茉莉穿上每套服装的模样都很耀眼喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0023_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "b5ca34d0f6e7a6b6353c33fc9a328f300b9e53c4a61e2bc899d6b5cbc558a350", "ja": "はいなのです！　姫のフワフワの魔法は、きゅーとな\nどうぶつさん達も、そーはっぴー！にしちゃうのです。", "zh": "对呀！公主的轻飘飘魔法，\n能让可爱动物们也都So Happy的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0023_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "b06b33db86faa9da7847498425ecb6001ec27839b20ca6a6efd4b7f99e1a2e42", "ja": "だから姫は、足がくたくたなのです。……ね？\n{$P$}さん？　……ね？", "zh": "所以说，公主脚好酸唷……呐？\n{$P$}先生？呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0023_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c884e6e6bbee89cf81ef6046863a4b4dc10aecb899a4dbab60cca1f28ea0e12c", "ja": "ひょっとして、まつり……\n俺に、マッサージしてほしい、って言ってるのか？", "zh": "该不会，茉莉……\n你是想叫我帮你按摩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0023_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "3861428fdcc953f7e56641b3f4256ce211bc48e3b69c44cd80e06eb1cac90f39", "ja": "ぴんぽーん！大正解、なのです！　さすが\n{$P$}さん、姫のナイトなのです。", "zh": "乒砰～！完全正确唷！\n{$P$}先生真不愧是公主的骑士呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0023_1006_p", "source_sha256": "caa5b1456f5187913864fbc6d85c34ab20b2b0c68326c9faf2f6dd6ef00255d3", "ja": "いや、ナイトとマッサージは、\nあんまり関係ないような……。", "zh": "不，骑士和按摩\n好像没什么关联……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0023_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "8ef486f012750bd04a19e7fa6452f3df8497eab5cadb56052943403830a9d94e", "ja": "マッサージ、してくれないのです？\nこのままじゃ姫の足が、棒になるのですー。", "zh": "你不帮公主按摩一下吗？\n再这样下去，公主的脚会僵得像棍子一样唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0023_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0e18e65a50bbc1b51980ce88857a2e272bd743ac2fa67486a6a054d3f9cc37b9", "ja": "しょうがないな……じゃあトレーニングルームで、\nストレッチでもしようか。まつり、着替えて集合だ！", "zh": "真拿你没办法……那就到训练房去做做伸展好了。\n茉莉，换完衣服后过去集合吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0023_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "8530dc090e1e1265715b1620a555a5591f087a7a962181547fce15afd25c2178", "ja": "わんだほー！　姫も、それがいいのです。\n{$P$}さん、ありがとーなのです！", "zh": "太美妙了！公主也想这么做的喔。\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
